  {
    "id": 186669,
    "title": "Train employees involved in operating a process and document the training.",
    "description": "Train employees involved in operating a process and document the training.\n\n- Train each employee currently involved in operating a process and each employee before starting a new process on the process overview and operating procedures.\n- Emphasize specific safety and health hazards, emergency operations, and safe work practices during training.\n- Certify in writing the knowledge, skills, and abilities of employees already involved in a process as of May 26, 1992, if initial training is not provided.\n- Provide refresher training at least every three years or more frequently if necessary, in consultation with employees.\n- Document that each employee has received and understood the training, including the employee's identity, training date, and verification method.",
    "type_id": 3,
    "category": 1,
    "priority": 0,
