  {
    "id": 186671,
    "title": "Establish and implement written procedures to maintain the ongoing integrity of process equipment.",
    "description": "Establish and implement written procedures to maintain the ongoing integrity of process equipment.\n\n- Establish and implement written procedures to maintain the ongoing integrity of process equipment.\n- Train employees involved in maintenance on process overview, hazards, and job-specific procedures to ensure safe task performance.\n- Perform inspections and tests on process equipment following recognized good engineering practices and document each inspection and test.\n- Correct equipment deficiencies outside acceptable limits before further use or in a safe and timely manner.\n- Ensure new equipment is suitable for its intended process application and perform checks to confirm proper installation.\n- Ensure maintenance materials, spare parts, and equipment are suitable for their intended process application.",
